# Contabo soft CPU pin — kube play does not persist HostConfig
# CpusetCpus or process nice. Re-applied after /health by
# scripts/apply-fullstack-soft-pin.sh.
#
# DRAFT ONLY. Do not merge, tag, or apply a packing change on Contabo
# until Robert picks A vs B and seats give critical +1s. Floki MOVE NO.
#
# Host snapshot (Release, locked): nproc=6, CPUs 0–5.
#
# =============================================================================
# APPLY-READY DEFAULT = live Contabo today (v1.6.15 option-1)
# =============================================================================
# Fullstack HostConfig 2-5 / nice -5. Music HostConfig UNSET.
# SEND 0-1 is in-process only (kube env → voice-rt). DECODE unset —
# pin_decode_child is wired but no-ops until kube sets TS6_BOT_DECODE_CPUSET.
# Never HostConfig-pin music to send-only 0-1 (packing C; rejected).
#
# CoS asked Robert to pick the next lever. Until that pick:
#   live stays 2-5. This file must not be Contabo-apply-ready for shrink.
#
# In-process keys (SEND / DECODE / NICE-in-thread) are read from the
# music *container env* (deploy/kube/ts6-manager.yaml), not from this
# file. HostConfig + host renice / optional chrt come from this file.
# Enabling A or B later means changing BOTH this file AND kube env,
# then update.sh (never kube down --force).
#
# Baseline dig (Angerfist, v1.6.15 option-1, music container wide):
#   und/C/stall per min 163/590/117 — worse than Sep17 soft-pin-only
#   HS PASS 133/248/60. Dominant C_loop_deferral; full buffer 249.
# Hypothesis (non-binding): ffmpeg/yt-dlp landing on send 0-1.

# --- live (apply-ready; matches Contabo until Robert picks) ---
TS6_FULLSTACK_CPUSET=2-5
TS6_FULLSTACK_NICE=-5

TS6_BOT_CPUSET=0-1
TS6_BOT_SEND_CPUSET=0-1
TS6_BOT_NICE=-5
# live: do not set music HostConfig; do not park DECODE yet
# TS6_BOT_CONTAINER_CPUSET=
# TS6_BOT_DECODE_CPUSET=

# Sidecar stays unpinned (do not steal send cores for MoQ).
# TS6_SIDECAR_CPUSET=
# TS6_SIDECAR_NICE=

# Host-side SCHED_FIFO / SCHED_RR via chrt — OPT-IN, default off.
# In-process setpriority as uid 10001 is EPERM without CAP_SYS_NICE;
# do not pretend the music process can renice itself. Prefer host
# renice (TS6_BOT_NICE above). RT needs proven need + usually
# CAP_SYS_NICE or rootful host chrt; no kube privileged default.
# TS6_BOT_CHRT_SCHED=
# TS6_BOT_CHRT_PRIO=

# Shrink cutover ACK — required by apply-fullstack-soft-pin.sh if
# TS6_FULLSTACK_CPUSET is 4-5 or 3-5. Default unset so a commented
# Profile A cannot become apply-ready by uncommenting only the
# cpuset line.
# TS6_SOFT_PIN_SHRINK_ACK=1

# =============================================================================
# Profile A — gated shrink cutover (NOT the apply-ready default)
# =============================================================================
# Music + Release consensus when Robert picks shrink:
#   fullstack HostConfig → 4-5 / nice -5  (3-5 if 4-5 too tight)
#   SEND 0-1 in-process only
#   DECODE 2-3 via pin_decode_child (ffmpeg / yt-dlp / warm-resolver)
#   music HostConfig prefer 0-3 (keeps music off Panel 4-5)
# Overnight risk: shrinking fullstack may regress Panel/API/Surreal
# under load. Robert must approve before Contabo update.sh / tag.
#
# To enable AFTER Robert + seats (never silently):
#   1) set TS6_SOFT_PIN_SHRINK_ACK=1
#   2) TS6_FULLSTACK_CPUSET=4-5
#   3) TS6_BOT_CONTAINER_CPUSET=0-3   (unset = spill risk onto 4-5)
#   4) kube music env TS6_BOT_DECODE_CPUSET=2-3
#   5) update.sh same-tag rewrite; exec probes; no --force
#
# TS6_FULLSTACK_CPUSET=4-5
# TS6_BOT_CONTAINER_CPUSET=0-3
# TS6_BOT_DECODE_CPUSET=2-3
# TS6_SOFT_PIN_SHRINK_ACK=1

# =============================================================================
# Profile B — gated no-shrink fallback (NOT enabled)
# =============================================================================
# If fullstack 2-5 stays locked:
#   music HostConfig unset or 0-5
#   SEND 0-1 in-process
#   DECODE=2-5 (share Axum/Surreal/Scuffed — still better than send 0-1)
# Still never HostConfig-only-0-1.
#
# TS6_FULLSTACK_CPUSET=2-5
# TS6_BOT_CONTAINER_CPUSET=
# TS6_BOT_DECODE_CPUSET=2-5

# =============================================================================
# Profile C — REJECT
# =============================================================================
# music HostConfig 0-1 + DECODE parked inside 0-1 (or DECODE off 0-1
# with fullstack still 2-5 and no third slice). v1.6.15 + Angerfist
# dig proved container-wide 0-1 traps ffmpeg on send cores / C_loop
# got worse. apply-fullstack-soft-pin.sh refuses send-only music
# HostConfig.
